openmediavault-garage (0.1.0-1) trixie; urgency=medium

  * Initial release. OpenMediaVault 8 plugin for Garage, the S3-compatible
    object storage, replacing the removed openmediavault-s3 plugin with
    native, non-containerized garage@<name> instances.
  * Manage multiple instances, each with datastores on shared folders,
    buckets with quotas and website hosting, access keys, and key-to-bucket
    permissions.
  * Optional public endpoint for the S3 API, used when Garage generates
    the public URL of an object. Requires garage 2.5.0 or later.
  * Optional vendored garage-webui, disabled by default, reachable only
    through the authenticated OMV web interface with one-click sign-in.

 -- bor <me@bor691.ir>  Sat, 24 Oct 2026 16:45:57 +0000
